<span id="S3.T2.6.4.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:189.8pt;">
<span id="S3.T2.6.4.3.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S3.T2.6.4.3.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic" style="font-size:90%;">“There are too many things to figure out when implementing the program, so I could not find answers to all the questions in my mind.”</span><span id="S3.T2.6.4.3.1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> - N3</span></span>
