</span></td></tr>
</table>
</figure>
<figure id="S6.T6" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table"><span id="S6.T6.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Table 6</span>. </span><span id="S6.T6.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Coefficients and p-values for the multiple linear regression predicting <span id="S6.T6.5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold ltx_font_italic">recall</span>. A positive coefficient with a small p-value indicates that the factor increases the recall. Participants who received DPCheatSheet achieved significantly higher recall (<math id="S6.T6.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="p&lt;0.001" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0.001</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p&lt;0.001</annotation></semantics></math>). They identified a greater proportion of all actual mistakes.</span></figcaption>
