<section id="A1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix A </span>Needfinding Study</h2>

<section id="A1.SS1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.1. </span>Prior DP Knowledge Questions</h3>

<div id="A1.SS1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<ol id="A1.I1" class="ltx_enumerate ltx_leftmargin_flush">
<li id="A1.I1.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">(1)</span> 
<div id="A1.I1.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I1.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Have you heard about differential privacy before?</p>
<ol id="A1.I1.i1.I1" class="ltx_enumerate">
<li id="A1.I1.i1.I1.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">(a)</span> 
<div id="A1.I1.i1.I1.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I1.i1.I1.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Yes</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I1.i1.I1.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">(b)</span> 
<div id="A1.I1.i1.I1.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I1.i1.I1.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">No</p>
</div></li>
</ol>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I1.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">(2)</span> 
<div id="A1.I1.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I1.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">What does a small epsilon value imply?</p>
<ol id="A1.I1.i2.I1" class="ltx_enumerate">
<li id="A1.I1.i2.I1.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">(a)</span> 
<div id="A1.I1.i2.I1.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I1.i2.I1.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Better accuracy</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I1.i2.I1.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">(b)</span> 
<div id="A1.I1.i2.I1.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I1.i2.I1.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.I1.i2.I1.i2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold ltx_font_italic">Strong privacy protection</span></p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I1.i2.I1.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">(c)</span> 
<div id="A1.I1.i2.I1.i3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I1.i2.I1.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Complete removal of personal data</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I1.i2.I1.i4" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">(d)</span> 
<div id="A1.I1.i2.I1.i4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I1.i2.I1.i4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">I’m not sure / I have no idea</p>
</div></li>
</ol>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I1.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">(3)</span> 
<div id="A1.I1.i3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I1.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Please name three techniques used to achieve differential privacy.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I1.i4" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">(4)</span> 
<div id="A1.I1.i4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I1.i4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">How many years of research experience do you have in differential privacy?</p>
<ol id="A1.I1.i4.I1" class="ltx_enumerate">
<li id="A1.I1.i4.I1.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">(a)</span> 
<div id="A1.I1.i4.I1.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I1.i4.I1.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Never</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I1.i4.I1.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">(b)</span> 
<div id="A1.I1.i4.I1.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I1.i4.I1.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Less than 1 year</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I1.i4.I1.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">(c)</span> 
<div id="A1.I1.i4.I1.i3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I1.i4.I1.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">1–2 years</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I1.i4.I1.i4" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">(d)</span> 
<div id="A1.I1.i4.I1.i4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I1.i4.I1.i4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">2–3years</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I1.i4.I1.i5" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">(e)</span> 
<div id="A1.I1.i4.I1.i5.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I1.i4.I1.i5.p1.1" class="ltx_p">More than 3 years</p>
</div></li>
</ol>
</div></li>
</ol>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A1.SS2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.2. </span>Task Description</h3>

<div id="A1.SS2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Imagine you are working at a software company that collects telemetry data to understand product performance. The telemetry dataset contains the following attributes (see Table  <a href="#A1.T10" title="Table 10 ‣ A.2. Task Description ‣ Appendix A Needfinding Study ‣ DPCheatSheet: Using Worked and Erroneous LLM-usage Examples to Scaffold Differential Privacy Implementation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">10</span></a>):</p>
</div>
<figure id="A1.T10" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering" style="font-size:90%;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 10. </span>Attributes of the synthetic telemetry dataset.</figcaption>
<table id="A1.T10.5" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_align_middle">
<tr id="A1.T10.5.1" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T10.5.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_l ltx_border_t"><span id="A1.T10.5.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">Attribute</span></td>
<td id="A1.T10.5.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_r ltx_border_t"><span id="A1.T10.5.1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">Description</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T10.5.2" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T10.5.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_l ltx_border_t"><span id="A1.T10.5.2.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Product Type</span></td>
<td id="A1.T10.5.2.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_r ltx_border_t"><span id="A1.T10.5.2.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">A categorical attribute indicating the type of product. Possible values are: <span id="A1.T10.5.2.2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">A</span>, <span id="A1.T10.5.2.2.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">B</span>, <span id="A1.T10.5.2.2.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">C</span>, <span id="A1.T10.5.2.2.1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">D</span>, <span id="A1.T10.5.2.2.1.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">E</span>, <span id="A1.T10.5.2.2.1.6" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">F</span>, and <span id="A1.T10.5.2.2.1.7" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">Others</span>.</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T10.5.3" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T10.5.3.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_l ltx_border_t"><span id="A1.T10.5.3.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Event Type</span></td>
<td id="A1.T10.5.3.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_r ltx_border_t"><span id="A1.T10.5.3.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">The type of event logged. Possible values are: <span id="A1.T10.5.3.2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">open</span>, <span id="A1.T10.5.3.2.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">close</span>, <span id="A1.T10.5.3.2.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">save</span>, <span id="A1.T10.5.3.2.1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">reset</span>, and <span id="A1.T10.5.3.2.1.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">error</span>.</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T10.5.4" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T10.5.4.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_l ltx_border_t"><span id="A1.T10.5.4.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Time of Event</span></td>
<td id="A1.T10.5.4.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_r ltx_border_t"><span id="A1.T10.5.4.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">A timestamp indicating when the event occurred, with values ranging from January 1, 2023, to December 31, 2023.</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T10.5.5" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T10.5.5.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_b ltx_border_l ltx_border_t"><span id="A1.T10.5.5.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">User ID</span></td>
<td id="A1.T10.5.5.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_b ltx_border_r ltx_border_t"><span id="A1.T10.5.5.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Anonymized ID of users who produced these events while using each product.</span></td></tr>
</table>
</figure>
<div id="A1.SS2.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS2.p2.1" class="ltx_p">Your task is to write a program to identify <span id="A1.SS2.p2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">product types with error rates larger than the average</span>. These are defined as product types with <span id="A1.SS2.p2.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">z-scores greater than 0</span>.</p>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS2.p3" class="ltx_para">
<ul id="A1.I2" class="ltx_itemize ltx_leftmargin_flush">
<li id="A1.I2.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I2.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I2.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.I2.i1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Error rate</span>: number of “error” events / total number of events.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I2.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I2.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I2.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.I2.i2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Average error rate</span>: the mean error rate across all product types.</p>
</div></li>
</ul>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS2.p4" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS2.p4.1" class="ltx_p">The results will be shared with collaborators. Therefore, while you have full access to the raw data, the results must comply with <span id="A1.SS2.p4.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">differential privacy guarantees</span> to protect user privacy.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A1.SS3" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.3. </span>Codebook</h3>

<div id="A1.SS3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">See Table <a href="#A1.T11" title="Table 11 ‣ A.3. Codebook ‣ Appendix A Needfinding Study ‣ DPCheatSheet: Using Worked and Erroneous LLM-usage Examples to Scaffold Differential Privacy Implementation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">11</span></a>.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A1.T11" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering" style="font-size:80%;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table"><span id="A1.T11.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:113%;">Table 11</span>. </span><span id="A1.T11.6" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:113%;">The complete codebook derived from our needfinding study.</span></figcaption>
<table id="A1.T11.7" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_align_middle">
<tr id="A1.T11.7.1" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T11.7.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_l ltx_border_r ltx_border_t">
<span id="A1.T11.7.1.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:51.7pt;">
<span id="A1.T11.7.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.T11.7.1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:80%;">Theme</span></span>
</span></td>
<td id="A1.T11.7.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_r ltx_border_t">
<span id="A1.T11.7.1.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:69.0pt;">
<span id="A1.T11.7.1.2.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.T11.7.1.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:80%;">Sub-Theme</span></span>
</span></td>
<td id="A1.T11.7.1.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_r ltx_border_t">
<span id="A1.T11.7.1.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:196.7pt;">
<span id="A1.T11.7.1.3.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.T11.7.1.3.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:80%;">Code</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T11.7.2" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T11.7.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_l ltx_border_r ltx_border_t">
<span id="A1.T11.7.2.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block" style="width:51.7pt;">
<span id="A1.T11.7.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">
<span id="A1.T11.7.2.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_middle" style="width:51.7pt;">
<span id="A1.T11.7.2.1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.T11.7.2.1.1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">Stuggles in setting DP configurations</span></span>
</span></span>
</span></td>
<td id="A1.T11.7.2.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_r ltx_border_t">
<span id="A1.T11.7.2.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block" style="width:69.0pt;">
<span id="A1.T11.7.2.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">
