<span id="A1.T11.7.7.3.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.T11.7.7.3.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">Difficulty interpreting how to set or adjust </span><math id="A1.T11.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\epsilon" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi mathsize="0.800em">ϵ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\epsilon</annotation></semantics></math><span id="A1.T11.7.7.3.1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;"> when the LLM accepts any value.</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
