<span id="A1.T11.7.8.3.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.T11.7.8.3.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">Confusion about substituting Laplace with other DP mechanisms when LLM provides no guidance.</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T11.7.9" class="ltx_tr">
