<span id="A1.T11.7.10.3.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.T11.7.10.3.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">Difficulty choosing parameter values without understanding how </span><math id="A1.T11.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\epsilon" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi mathsize="0.800em">ϵ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\epsilon</annotation></semantics></math><span id="A1.T11.7.10.3.1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;"> protects data.</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T11.7.11" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T11.7.11.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_l ltx_border_r"></td>
<td id="A1.T11.7.11.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_r"></td>
<td id="A1.T11.7.11.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_r ltx_border_t">
<span id="A1.T11.7.11.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:196.7pt;">
<span id="A1.T11.7.11.3.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.T11.7.11.3.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">Need for worked examples to guide parameter selection in context.</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T11.7.12" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T11.7.12.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_l ltx_border_r"></td>
<td id="A1.T11.7.12.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_r"></td>
