<span id="A1.T11.7.15.3.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.T11.7.15.3.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">Feelings of discouragement about being unable to understand all DP concepts.</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T11.7.16" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T11.7.16.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_l ltx_border_r"></td>
<td id="A1.T11.7.16.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_r"></td>
<td id="A1.T11.7.16.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_r ltx_border_t">
