</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T11.7.17" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T11.7.17.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_l ltx_border_r"></td>
<td id="A1.T11.7.17.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_r ltx_border_t">
<span id="A1.T11.7.17.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:69.0pt;">
<span id="A1.T11.7.17.2.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.T11.7.17.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">Confused by program output</span></span>
</span></td>
<td id="A1.T11.7.17.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_r ltx_border_t">
<span id="A1.T11.7.17.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:196.7pt;">
<span id="A1.T11.7.17.3.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.T11.7.17.3.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">Uncertain about whether noisy outputs with extreme values (e.g., all 0s or 1s) are meaningful.</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T11.7.18" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T11.7.18.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_l ltx_border_r"></td>
<td id="A1.T11.7.18.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_r"></td>
<td id="A1.T11.7.18.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_r ltx_border_t">
<span id="A1.T11.7.18.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:196.7pt;">
<span id="A1.T11.7.18.3.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.T11.7.18.3.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">Difficulty understanding noisy z-scores close to true values; uncertainty about privacy protection.</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T11.7.19" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T11.7.19.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_l ltx_border_r"></td>
