<td id="A1.T11.7.19.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_r ltx_border_t">
<span id="A1.T11.7.19.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:196.7pt;">
<span id="A1.T11.7.19.3.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.T11.7.19.3.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">Confusion about why the MSE vs. epsilon graph is not convex; unclear about expected relationships.</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T11.7.20" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T11.7.20.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_l ltx_border_r"></td>
